5 02:15:53 -0700</pubDate><guid>https://www.zooberry.org/mods/zt1/objects/foliage/pampas-grass/</guid><description>The Pampas Grass ztd is a south america plant that can be used in the Rhea&amp;rsquo;s exhibit, but it is not obligatory. I&amp;rsquo;ve created it from the z2f file made by Aurora Designs.</description></item><item><title>Sailors Outright Crew - Land in Sight</title><link>https://www.zooberry.org/mods/zt1/expansive-packs/sailors-outright-crew/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Jan 2025 07:34:23 -0700</pubDate><guid>https://www.zooberry.org/mods/zt1/expansive-packs/sailors-outright-crew/</guid><description>Adds nine dinosaurs and 13 scrub biome items. Previously known as &amp;ldquo;SaiLords of Land &amp;amp; Water&amp;rdquo;</description></item><item><title>Halloween Collab Pack 2024</title><link>https://www.zooberry.org/mods/zt1/expansive-packs/halloween-collab-pack-2024/</link><pubDate>Thu, 31 Oct 2024 01:09:23 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.zooberry.org/mods/zt1/expansive-packs/halloween-collab-pack-2024/</guid><description>A small collaboration pack from a few Zoo Tycoon 1 designers which adds in various items, foliage and animals in order to make your zoo feel a bit more seasonal.</description></item><item><title>Mexico Natural Icons Pack</title><link>https://www.zooberry.org/mods/zt1/expansive-packs/mexico-natural-icons/</link><pubDate>Sun, 06 Oct 2024 01:09:23 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.zooberry.org/mods/zt1/expansive-packs/mexico-natural-icons/</guid><description>A pack containing five new animals, five new foliage items, and five new animated scenery items.</description></item><item><title>Bug Mayhem</title><link>https://www.zooberry.org/mods/zt1/expansive-packs/bug-mayhem/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 11:15:53 -0700</pubDate><guid>https://www.zooberry.org/mods/zt1/expansive-packs/bug-mayhem/</guid><description>A little expansion pack containing items for a full terrarium of arthropods!</description></item><item><title>WLP1 Foliage Pack Part 6<